%% Diagram source: docs/diagram/event-flow.mmd
sequenceDiagram
  participant R as PresenceRuntime
  participant B as Process-local event bus
  participant P as Producer
  participant V as Strict validator
  participant S as Retained state and fence
  participant U as Presentation
  participant C as cmux

  R->>B: session start: ready v1
  B->>P: capabilities include presence-remove-v1
  P->>B: update or attention-none replay
  B->>R: update v1
  R->>V: validate object, session, shared fence
  Note over V: reject reserved source, stale fence,<br/>or source limit exceeded
  V->>S: replace state and advance fence
  S->>U: current retained states
  U->>C: deterministic status / progress / attention
  P->>B: remove v1 with higher sequence
  B->>R: remove v1
  R->>V: validate object, session, shared fence
  V->>S: delete retained state, keep fence tombstone
  S->>U: recompute remaining state
  U->>C: clear exact status / reselect progress / meta
  Note over U,C: no new generic notification, flash, log, or feed
  R->>S: session teardown cleanup
  R->>C: clear owned output
